 # Refactor the parser                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                             
 ## Summary                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                             
 Split the parser into a lexer and a grammar.                                                                                
                                                                                                                             
 ## Steps                                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                             
 1. Extract a tokeniser module                                                                                               
    - Files: parser/lex.go                                                                                                   
    - Files: parser/lex_test.go                                                                                              
    - Verify: go test ./parser                                                                                               
 2. Rewrite the grammar in terms of tokens                                                                                   
    - Files: parser/grammar.go                                                                                               
    - Verify: go test ./parser                                                                                               
                                                                                                                             
 ## Test Plan                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                             
 - go test ./...                                                                                                             
 - go vet ./...                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                             
 ## Assumptions                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                             
 - The token vocabulary is stable.                                                                                           
                                                                                                                             
 ## Risks                                                                                                                    
 ● approve — execute here                                                                                                    
 ○ approve — execute in a new session                                                                                        
 ○ edit — open in $EDITOR, then approve                                                                                      
 ○ refine — send notes back to the planner                                                                                   
 ○ cancel — keep the file and stay in plan mode                                                                              
                                                                                                                             
